    "    17 |   |      +-------------+   |   |   rows 17-20 lower infield",
    "    21 |   +------------------------+   |   rows 21-26 bottom road",
    "    27 +--------------------------------+",
    "",
    "cols 1-6 is the left road, 33-38 the right. The two infield blocks meet",
